// endpoint_merge_workspace.proto — MergeWorkspace. SIDEBAR section.
// Enqueue a merge that RUNS IN the requesting workspace. Success means
// ENQUEUED — the merge's whole life from the queue onward is the requesting
// workspace's own: its feed's merge bubble, its footer's merging status, and
// its own session doing any conflict resolution and test fixing. No
// workspace is ever created for a merge. The merge targets the merged
// branch's parent by definition, and the daemon decides everything else.

